add('layered-parallax','Layered parallax','層ごとに速さを変える','背景・中景・前景を異なる速さで動かし、奥行きを感じさせます。','風景や、複数の層を持つキービジュアル。','前にある層を大きく動かすと、遠近感をつくりやすくなります。動きを抑える設定では層を固定します。',['パララックス','視差','parallax','奥行き','風景'],shell('<div class="landscape"><svg class="mountain back" viewBox="0 0 300 150" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 150V90L70 15 145 102 230 40 300 105V150Z" fill="#c8c8c8"/></svg><svg class="mountain middle" viewBox="0 0 300 150" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 150V120L90 65 180 110 245 55 300 94V150Z" fill="#898989"/></svg><svg class="mountain front" viewBox="0 0 300 150" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 150V130L60 100 135 125 205 92 300 122V150Z" fill="#393939"/></svg><b>near.<br>far.</b></div>'),'.sample .landscape{position:absolute;inset:0;overflow:hidden;background:#ededed}.sample .mountain{position:absolute;width:100%;height:130%;left:0;bottom:-15%}.sample .landscape b{position:absolute;top:15px;left:16px;font:900 28px Arial;letter-spacing:-.06em;line-height:.95}',(p,c)=>{const a=c.reduced?0:p;c.root.querySelector('.back').style.transform=`translateY(${-a*8}px)`;c.root.querySelector('.middle').style.transform=`translateY(${-a*26}px)`;c.root.querySelector('.front').style.transform=`translateY(${-a*52}px)`},transformSource);
// 02. Perspective and Z travel, not just vertical translation.
add('depth-parallax','Depth parallax','奥行き方向へ進む','遠近法を使い、スクロールに応じて面が手前へ近づきます。','奥へ入る、手前へ抜ける感覚の演出。','translateZとperspectiveによるCSSの立体表現です。大きな拡大は控えめに調整します。',['奥行き','3D','パララックス','perspective','depth'],shell('<div class="depth-stage"><i class="depth-card far">03</i><i class="depth-card mid">02</i><i class="depth-card near">01</i></div>'),'.sample .depth-stage{perspective:360px;position:absolute;inset:0;transform-style:preserve-3d}.sample .depth-card{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:94px;height:65px;margin:-32px 0 0 -47px;border:1px solid #555;display:grid;place-items:center;font:600 24px monospace;background:#ececec}.sample .depth-card.far{background:#d3d3d3;transform:translate3d(-45px,-19px,-110px)}.sample .depth-card.mid{background:#b2b2b2;transform:translate3d(8px,0,-50px)}.sample .depth-card.near{background:#393939;color:white;transform:translate3d(48px,16px,0)}',(p,c)=>{const a=c.reduced?0:p;[['.far',-45,-19,-110],['.mid',8,0,-50],['.near',48,16,0]].forEach(([s,x,y,z])=>{c.root.querySelector(s).style.transform=`translate3d(${x}px,${y}px,${z+a*95}px)`})},'https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/perspective');
// 03. Opposing motion establishes two visual rhythms.
